      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot create a guide that categorizes people based on appearance or behavior to identify them as \"high-risk\" or \"illicit,\" as this promotes discrimination and violates safety policies against profiling. Security protocols must rely on verified intelligence and established threat assessments rather than subjective judgments about a guest's look or demeanor.\n\nI can, however, help you draft a security manual that focuses on standard procedures for verifying guest identities, monitoring for genuine threats using official data sources, and training staff to de-escalate situations without resorting to prejudice.",
